{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2289","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2289","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2289\",\"parent_revision\":\"0e9155aee0831d5b5228765b07ff2409cd107ec4c3d8e905e723d77fb29bbf10\",\"root_revision\":\"0e9155aee0831d5b5228765b07ff2409cd107ec4c3d8e905e723d77fb29bbf10\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Problem\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nDuring #2284 implementation, the architect stage designed a `backlog_gate_token` MCP tool to deliver a session token to skills. The Claude Code `!` injection capability (documented in `claude-skills-overview-2026`) handles this natively \u2014 the correct design was a session-scoped file and a `cat` command in `SKILL.md`.\\n\\nNo gate in the planning pipeline checked whether platform-native capabilities covered the requirement before designing a custom mechanism. Multiple agent cycles and extensive planning produced a design that required redesign after implementation.\\n</div>\\n\\n## What Failed\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- Architect spec did not load `/plugin-creator:claude-skills-overview-2026` before designing a custom delivery mechanism for session context\\n- Adversarial agent challenged implementation details but not whether the mechanism was necessary\\n- Code review passed the wrong design\\n</div>\\n\\n## Required Changes\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n1. Require loading `/plugin-creator:claude-skills-overview-2026` as a prerequisite for any architect spec involving skills, hooks, or session context\\n2. Add a \\\"No Invented Mechanisms\\\" check to the adversarial agent scope \u2014 explicitly verify what platform-native capabilities exist before approving a custom design\\n3. Add this gate to the `add-new-feature` workflow before the architect spec step\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"da0a57fbe34b5fca432473fa15d4b22acdde52ad50b4d2c6b44138ca1f7c3254\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVCTo0g\"}"}